==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Germanic|kweþanan|lang=ang}}.  Cognate with Old Frisian {{term|qwetha|lang=ofs}}, Old Saxon {{term|queþan|lang=osx}}, Old High German {{term|quedan|lang=goh}}, Old Norse {{term|kveða|lang=non}} (Swedish {{term|kväda|lang=sv}}), Gothic {{term|𐌵𐌹𐌸𐌰𐌽|sc=Goth|lang=got}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkweðɑn/|lang=ang}}, {{SAMPA|/"kweDAn/|lang=ang}}

===Verb===
{{ang-verb|type=strong|class=V}}

# to [[say]], [[tell]]

